Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.25,0:00:00.90,neru,,0,0,0,,{\b1}喂 Miku
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.92,0:00:01.64,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}怎么了 Neru？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.09,0:00:03.13,neru,,0,0,0,,{\b1}那个……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.14,0:00:04.89,neru,,0,0,0,,{\b1}还记得咱俩打的赌吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.92,0:00:05.46,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.47,0:00:06.00,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}什么赌？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:08.35,neru,,0,0,0,,{\b1}要是我哪天有了自己的声库
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:10.28,neru,,0,0,0,,{\b1}你就得唱《Stop Nagging Me》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.59,0:00:11.35,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.35,0:00:13.13,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}说得好像真会有那天似的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.13,0:00:14.28,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}我跟你讲过的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.30,0:00:15.54,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}等你有声库那天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.56,0:00:17.50,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}就是 Teto 变成 Vocaloid 那天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.66,0:00:18.83,teto,,0,0,0,,{\b1}闭——嘴！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.84,0:00:20.81,teto,,0,0,0,,{\b1}所以你现在才没有 SynthV 声库啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.34,0:00:23.38,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}算了……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.40,0:00:24.02,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}那又怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.05,0:00:24.70,neru,,0,0,0,,{\b1}我做到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.72,0:00:26.13,neru,,0,0,0,,{\b1}我有自己的声库了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.53,0:00:29.73,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}不可能！你骗人！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.95,0:00:31.10,neru,,0,0,0,,{\b1}喏，你自己看
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.73,0:00:51.86,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}你成 UTAU 了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.88,0:00:53.02,neru,,0,0,0,,{\b1}对呀！我太开心了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.03,0:00:56.87,neru,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(506,838)}现在你不能再笑话\N我是个假 Vocaloid 了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.90,0:00:58.09,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}不公平！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.11,0:00:59.49,neru,,0,0,0,,{\b1}现在你得唱我的歌了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.52,0:01:00.41,neru,,0,0,0,,{\b1}哈哈~
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.80,0:01:02.03,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}我……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.19,0:01:03.50,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}我恨死你了……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.57,0:01:05.27,neru,,0,0,0,,{\b1}哭去吧 混蛋
